BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 609 Tm (A constitution names offices.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 575 Tm (A dossier teaches you how those offices live.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 541 Tm (After the first three books, the reader of Concentric knows the city's origin, its) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 526 Tm (major reforms, and the coming trial of its highest judge. But a republic cannot be) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 511 Tm (fully imagined from high doctrine alone. One must also walk its ministries room by) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 496 Tm (room and learn their habits, strengths, weaknesses, and political burdens.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 462 Tm (That is the purpose of this book.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 428 Tm (It is not the book of amendments. That comes later.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 394 Tm (It is not the book of verdict. That has not yet earned the right to exist.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 360 Tm (It is the book of departments: the living anatomy of the state.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 326 Tm (Each chapter in this book is a portrait of one ministry or one tightly allied) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 311 Tm (cluster of institutions. The question of each portrait is the same:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 277 Tm (What kind of office is this, what does it really do, and what happens to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 262 Tm (republic if it weakens, drifts, or speaks falsely?) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 210 Tm (Chapter 2: The Executive Office) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 176 Tm (The Executive Office of Concentric is not merely where tasks begin. It is where the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 161 Tm (republic interprets the existence of a task as a matter of state.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 127 Tm (This office lives most visibly in operator/agent.py. There the city takes in a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 112 Tm (mission and decides what sort of thing is being asked of it. Is this a URL-driven) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 97 Tm (mission? Does the browser matter? Is research needed first? Should site-specific) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 82 Tm (knowledge be consulted? Are the correct ministries staffed?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 28 Tm (Page 3 of 34) Tj ET
