BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 723 Tm (In a weak state, the executive is only a dispatcher. In Concentric it is more than) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 708 Tm (that. It is the office that determines which institutions will be considered) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 693 Tm (relevant, which evidence will be gathered, and how the city will define the shape) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 678 Tm (of action before action begins.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 644 Tm (It is also a politically dangerous office, because executives always are. When an) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 629 Tm (executive becomes too large, it starts to absorb the craft knowledge of lower) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 614 Tm (ministries. This is one of the standing tensions in Concentric even now. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 599 Tm (executive still holds more site-specific artistry than a perfectly decentralized) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 584 Tm (republic would prefer. It not only coordinates the state; in some places it still) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 569 Tm (remembers too much of how particular provinces behave.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 535 Tm (But one should not miss its legitimate greatness.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 501 Tm (The Executive Office is where:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 467 Tm (• host readiness is checked) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 435 Tm (• capabilities are activated) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 403 Tm (• research is commissioned) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 371 Tm (• planning is selected) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 339 Tm (• execution context is assembled) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 307 Tm (• final verification is invoked) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 275 Tm (• runs are finalized into state memory) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 243 Tm (If the executive fails, the rest of the republic may remain technically capable and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 228 Tm (still fail to act coherently. This is because the office does not merely issue) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 213 Tm (orders. It defines whether the city will experience its own mission as one problem) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 198 Tm (or several.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 164 Tm (Its virtue is orchestration.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 130 Tm (Its vice is accretion.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 96 Tm (Its permanent constitutional temptation is to believe that because it can see the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 81 Tm (whole state, it should also directly own the skills of every ministry beneath it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 28 Tm (Page 4 of 34) Tj ET
