BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 715 Tm (Chapter 3: The Legislature, the Civil Service Commission, and the Council of Model Economy) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 681 Tm (There are three neighboring institutions that together govern what kind of action) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 666 Tm (may exist in public life.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 632 Tm (The first is the Legislature, represented by operator/action_space.py. This is the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 617 Tm (public code of state actions. It does not move the world itself. It names the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 602 Tm (legally meaningful forms of movement. Here the city decides which verbs belong in) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 587 Tm (ordinary planning law and what parameters those verbs require.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 553 Tm (The second is the Civil Service Commission, represented by) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 538 Tm (operator/capability_router.py. Its role is not to create law, but to decide which) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 523 Tm (ministries are staffed for a given mission. A mature republic does not open every) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 508 Tm (bureau for every task. It learns which institutions are required, which are) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 493 Tm (optional, and which are excessive.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 459 Tm (The third is the Council of Model Economy, represented by) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 444 Tm (operator/inference_router.py. This body exists because Concentric is not only a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 429 Tm (city of law and muscle, but of scarce cognitive expenditure. The republic must) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 414 Tm (decide when a cheap mind is enough, when a deep mind is necessary, and how to route) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 399 Tm (judgments so the city does not bankrupt itself trying to think at maximum depth) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 384 Tm (about every pebble in the road.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 350 Tm (Together, these three institutions govern public possibility.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 316 Tm (The Legislature names the acts. The Commission staffs the offices. The Council) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 301 Tm (prices cognition.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 267 Tm (Before the constitutional reforms, this cluster contained one of the city's most) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 252 Tm (dangerous legal ambiguities: the public code could overstate the capabilities of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 237 Tm (the live ministries. After reform, the cluster became more honest. The Legislature) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 222 Tm (narrowed the planner-visible law, the conformance court held it accountable, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 207 Tm (the public verbs of the city became less aspirational and more executable.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 173 Tm (The political lesson of this cluster is that possibility is not a single thing. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 158 Tm (is the interaction of legality, staffing, and cost.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 106 Tm (Chapter 4: The Planning Ministry) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 72 Tm (The Planning Ministry is one of the republic's most intellectually ambitious) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 57 Tm (institutions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 28 Tm (Page 5 of 34) Tj ET
