BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 580 Tm (path.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 546 Tm (The ministry's importance lies in its refusal to let action begin as mere impulse.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 531 Tm (It asks the city to pause, study, and build doctrine before it reaches for the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 516 Tm (world.) Tj ET
