BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 433 Tm (But the Planning Ministry carries a unique danger: fantasy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 399 Tm (A planner can always look brilliant on paper. It can generate primary plans,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 384 Tm (secondary plans, verification hints, tool mappings, and fallback paths. Yet if the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 369 Tm (plan names powers that the republic cannot actually execute, then the ministry) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 354 Tm (becomes a theater of intelligence rather than an engine of action.) Tj ET
