BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 305 Tm (hardened Phase 3 so fallback actions had to be real, not just decorative. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 290 Tm (Planning Ministry was required to fear imaginary escape routes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 256 Tm (Its virtue is doctrine.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 222 Tm (Its vice is seduction by abstraction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 188 Tm (Its constitutional burden is to remain a ministry of mapping rather than a ministry) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 173 Tm (of hallucinated sovereignty.) Tj ET
