BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 478 Tm (Concentric has not allowed that.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 444 Tm (But it also has not outgrown the need for vigilance.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 392 Tm (Chapter 7: The Great Achievement of the Present Republic) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 358 Tm (If one asks what Concentric is now capable of that it was not capable of in its) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 343 Tm (earlier eras, the answer is not merely "more actions.") Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 309 Tm (Its deeper achievements are these:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 275 Tm (• the planner can speak more truthfully) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 243 Tm (• the streets are more aligned with public law) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 211 Tm (• the archive can distinguish execution from acceptance) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 179 Tm (• the auditors speak a cleaner language of outcome) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 147 Tm (• the republic can mechanically detect important classes of constitutional) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 115 Tm (drift) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 81 Tm (• the highest judge can be subjected to a real calibration study) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 28 Tm (Page 31 of 34) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
