67 0 obj
<< /Length 2423 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 723 Tm (These achievements together amount to a change in regime type.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 689 Tm (The city is no longer merely an ingenious machine of action.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 655 Tm (It is becoming a governable state of action.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 621 Tm (That is the great achievement of the unfinished republic: it has become strong) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 606 Tm (enough for legitimacy to matter more than cleverness alone.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 554 Tm (Chapter 8: The Next Constitutional Sequence) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 520 Tm (If the jury were to arrive tomorrow, the republic would not become finished. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 505 Tm (would enter a new constitutional phase.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 471 Tm (The most likely next sequence would look something like this:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 437 Tm (1. Human jurors review the six packets. 2. Consensus or disagreement establishes) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 422 Tm (the first live civic map of judge reliability. 3. The republic learns whether the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 407 Tm (Supreme Inspectorate is too strict, too lax, or operating in terrain humans also) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 392 Tm (find ambiguous. 4. That learning feeds back into verification design, benchmark) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 377 Tm (validity, and perhaps the city's future confidence in autonomous acceptance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 343 Tm (Then new questions follow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 309 Tm (Should the judge's prompts change? Should the evidence packets change? Should more) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 294 Tm (tasks be sampled? Should the archive collect richer comparison artifacts? Should) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 279 Tm (some task families be treated as inherently more ambiguous?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 245 Tm (The unfinished republic is therefore not a still point. It is a state on the verge) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 230 Tm (of a more externally grounded phase of government.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 178 Tm (Chapter 9: The Locked Seventh Book) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 144 Tm (There is one book this republic has not yet earned.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 110 Tm (Call it:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 76 Tm (• The Trial Proper) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 28 Tm (Page 32 of 34) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
