stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 723 Tm (• The Verdict of the Republic) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 691 Tm (• The Calibration of the Judge) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 659 Tm (The title matters less than the rule governing its existence:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 625 Tm (it cannot be written honestly until the jurors have spoken.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 591 Tm (This is one of the noblest constraints in the whole project.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 557 Tm (The republic could pretend to know its future. It could write a triumphalist) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 542 Tm (epilogue in advance. It could imagine that because the machinery for judgment) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 527 Tm (exists, the legitimacy of judgment has already been won.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 493 Tm (It has refused to do so.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 459 Tm (The locked seventh book therefore stands as a sign of restraint. It marks the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 444 Tm (difference between a project interested in self-flattery and a project interested) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 429 Tm (in public truth.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 377 Tm (Chapter 10: Christian and the Republic That Can Wait) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 343 Tm (To build a city is one form of ambition.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 309 Tm (To build a city that can wait for truth is a deeper one.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 275 Tm (Christian has already founded, expanded, constitutionalized, and audited the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 260 Tm (republic of Concentric. He has built its ministries, repaired its tunnels,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 245 Tm (disciplined its lawbook, unified its registry, and prepared the court for its) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 230 Tm (highest judge.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 196 Tm (And yet the most mature act available to him now is not more dominion.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 162 Tm (It is patience.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 128 Tm (Patience with unfinished institutions. Patience with the arrival of outside) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 113 Tm (judgment. Patience with the idea that real legitimacy cannot always be engineered) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 98 Tm (directly from inside the palace.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 64 Tm (This is why the unfinished republic should not be read as a tragedy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 28 Tm (Page 33 of 34) Tj ET
endstream
