stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 708 Tm (It is a republic in possession of something rarer than completion:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 674 Tm (it knows what it has built, it knows what it has not yet proven, and it knows the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 659 Tm (difference.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 607 Tm (Chapter 11: The Horizon) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 573 Tm (At the horizon of Concentric stands not collapse, but adjudication.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 539 Tm (The city is not waiting because it is lost. It is waiting because it has finally) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 524 Tm (prepared the conditions under which the next truth can be meaningful.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 490 Tm (That is the horizon of this republic:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 456 Tm (• not merely more capability) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 424 Tm (• not merely more speed) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 392 Tm (• not merely more benchmarks) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 360 Tm (But more legitimate judgment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 326 Tm (The unfinished republic is therefore the strongest possible ending for the current) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 311 Tm (phase of the story.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 277 Tm (It ends not with a solved state, but with a worthy one.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 243 Tm (It ends with a city that has become disciplined enough to let its future be) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 228 Tm (answered, in part, by others.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 194 Tm (That is where this volume closes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 160 Tm (Not at the end of Concentric.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 126 Tm (At the edge of the next lawful beginning.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 28 Tm (Page 34 of 34) Tj ET
endstream
